# **Maharashtra Drought Management & Cattle Camp Management System**

Your idea can be developed into a statewide digital platform that connects farmers, government veterinary hospitals, cattle camp operators, water tanker suppliers, fodder suppliers, revenue officials, and senior government officers.

I would recommend developing it as a **Maharashtra Digital Drought & Livestock Relief Management System**.

The primary objective should be:

**Every animal registered, every fodder and water delivery recorded, every farmer's complaint addressed, and every government subsidy accounted for digitally.**

The most important part of your idea is that it should not be limited to animal registration. It should manage the complete lifecycle of drought relief operations, from identifying affected farmers to animal admission, daily fodder and water distribution, inspections, complaints, and government reimbursement.

